{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e15dc29d2718bc4e4f8e42188c961c37370f914bff08a11534ff76dddb041e8",
      "text": "“一想到喜欢的人，在夜里也会睡不着”……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:354063e1b0356f180b80caae0f4b3a6f8e631c4be52cec98ee6dc9e5c82f168a",
      "text": "厉害啊，能为某样事物沉迷到这种地步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758d9c2b362e50499ec0ffa10b94dcbdcc3d4a0c31ffe631cdb4fe6d9f90722b",
      "text": "……恭二先生没有过这种经历吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e5edd75b82f51842d8933e721198d9ba869c4dec8405f18b24990e4406758f2",
      "text": "我啊……也是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ba978d32c355157be95ffe034139b3ce6bc12dfca5796b332ac0e7fefba57e6",
      "text": "（脑海中一下子浮现出的，是在那个家里时的自己）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:413710a3d474536733fab20c11e9f77150f7216110679f9e222622d6110ccd03",
      "text": "（那时候老爸和大哥以“为了鹰城家”为由，\n硬给我灌输了那么多无聊的东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:864944d26512b3131e936c3ce4eee90903dd5595a7c34180b880c0ef00075f24",
      "text": "（……每天都在拼命硬撑着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf4ee1544d0d0862d3d6ed205d8df7e10b24b1772de4f3f343b10eab434fa385",
      "text": "……比起沉迷，我倒是经历过拼命挣扎的时期。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73e01be47b5ecfd979b334e7203bd764e7ca4eed6357b1b82549af344289c5ca",
      "text": "而且最后什么成果都没拿出来……\n有一阵子，我为此消沉堕落了相当长的时间呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1fd0172f9db7958ccc23199e0c9821a7572362f8a559162135b945ff3607445",
      "text": "不过现在，在这里……我找到了自己真正\n能够沉迷进去的事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca7881a0d77795fc65de6d30c90730266935e2dd3ccd32ac9ac206656564f90",
      "text": "也许我也快要像这个人一样，\n变得夜不能寐了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
